# Coding standards

## React / Next.js 16

- Server Components default; `"use client"` only for state/effects/browser APIs
- React Compiler enabled — **avoid** default `useMemo` / `useCallback` / manual memo unless profiling shows need
- Prefer `useEffectEvent`, `startTransition`, `useDeferredValue` when already used / clearly beneficial — not by default
- `await params` / `await searchParams` (Promises in Next 16)
- Mutations today: **Route Handlers** (`app/api/*`) + Zod — see `17-security.mdc`
- Server Actions (`"use server"`): only if product requires them; still Zod-validate inputs, never trust client
- Do **not** adopt `"use cache"` / Cache Components unless the team explicitly migrates — stick to `revalidate` + tags
- Failures: `notFound()` for missing CMS docs; root `app/error.tsx` for unexpected errors — keep copy Urdu

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — sync params in Next 16
export default function Page({ params }: { params: { slug: string } }) { … }

// ✅ GOOD
export default async function Page({ params }: { params: Promise<{ slug: string }> }) {
  const { slug } = await params
  …
}
```

## TypeScript & data

- `type` for props; strict TS; no `any` (narrow with Zod / type guards)
- Zod schemas live in `lib/` — API routes `safeParse`, never trust raw JSON
- GROQ only in `sanity/lib/queries.ts`; pages call `get*` fetchers (`safeFetch`) — `04-sanity.mdc` · `16-dry.mdc`
- No Sanity/nodemailer/secrets in client components

## UI & a11y

- `<Link>` / `<Image>` with explicit `sizes` — except LCP hero (`HeroSection` + `LcpImagePreload`)
- `pageMetadata()` for all `generateMetadata`; `[...slug]` → `join('/')`
- Portable Text → `RichTextBody` + `TW_RICH_TEXT_*`
- Cards: one interactive link (`ContentCard`) · leaf heroes → `LeafHero`
- Interactive: `min-h-11` + visible `focus-visible`; respect `motion-reduce`
- Layout: mobile-first + fluid (`18-mobile-first-responsive.mdc`) — no fixed `w-[1200px]`-style shells
- UX/nav/touch: `19-ui-ux.mdc`
- Hydration: no `Date.now()` / `Math.random()` / locale-differing markup without a client boundary

